# Testing

- Swift Testing (`@Test`), not XCTest.
- Use `TestSupport`: `FakeClock`, `InMemorySettingsStore`, `FakePermissions`, `RecordingEventBus`, `TestFeatureContext.make()`.
- Do not hit live TCC, IOKit, Accessibility or the pasteboard in a unit test.
- ControlSurface: codec and router are unit-tested; the socket is an in-process temp-path test. No launchd, no codesign in unit tests.
- Do not add XCUITest. Menu-bar apps fail on headless CI before tests start. See `docs/testing.md`.
- A feature that uses a private API must ship a symbol-resolve test.
